# Phase 33 licensing: vendor Ed25519 private signing key and generated
# license files must never be committed. Only the public key (embedded in
# src/server/licensing/public-keys.ts) is checked in. .license-runtime/ is
# the local fallback data root used only when HAMDFOODS_DATA_ROOT is unset
# (dev, test, and local `pnpm production:*` runs), never real ProgramData.
.licensing/
*.lic
.license-runtime/
*.pfx
*.p12
